            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">Branded Practice Information Editor</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Every change persists in your browser & updates your public link immediately.</p>
              </div>
